<title>POLAND: BRE, Pictet to manage fund.</title>
<headline>BRE, Pictet to manage fund.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish  Bank Rozowoju Eksportu SA (BRE) and the Geneva-based bank Pictet et Cie have set up a company to manage an investment fund, BRE said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the firm, Famco SA, will manage a fund, to be created in Luxembourg, which will invest in shares of Polish unlisted companies and in units of the mass privatisation programme.</p>
<p>The statement provided no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
